      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "This was added to work around `boost::filesystem` throwing when the environments locale was invalid. Boost.Filesystem has been removed, and `std::filesystem` doesn't use the locale on POSIX (and bitcoind never calls `setlocale`).\n\nQt calls `setlocale(LC_ALL, \"\")` on startup, and falls back to `C.UTF-8` if the locale isn't `UTF-8`.\n\nAlternative to #36399, which extends the hack further.",
    "labels": [],
