      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 788d46fb60ff145968535e629bb7ecc6ea43f297\nparent 173ec9a06cf6a1619a1d62cbace6520c1ada0201\nauthor fanquake <fanquake@gmail.com> 1790936180 +0100\ncommitter fanquake <fanquake@gmail.com> 1791963438 +0900\n\ncommon: drop locale setting hack\n\nThis was added to work around `boost::filesystem` throwing when the\nenvironments locale was invalid. Boost.Filesystem has been removed, and\n`std::filesystem` doesn't use the locale on POSIX (and bitcoind never\ncalls `setlocale`).\n\nQt calls `setlocale(LC_ALL, \"\")` on startup, and falls back to C.UTF-8\nif the locale isn't UTF-8.\n",
